        //   Then max(0, s-t) = s-t
        //   Number of dc = (l-s) - (s-t) + 1 = l - 2s + t + 1
        //   This must be >= 0, so l - 2s + t + 1 >= 0 => 2s <= l + t + 1 => s <= (l+t+1)/2
